{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19586","headline":"和李德裕游汉州房公湖二首 二 · 郑澣","name":"和李德裕游汉州房公湖二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静对烟波夕，犹思栋宇青。\n卧龙空有处，驯鸟独忘情。\n顾步襟期远，参差物象横。\n自宜雕乐石，爽气际青城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑澣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19586.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19586","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}